1
00:00:02,544 --> 00:00:05,172
[LORNA] So it turns out
Miss Zariché was plotting

2
00:00:05,255 --> 00:00:07,216
to use pollen
from the Queen's Heart Rose

3
00:00:07,299 --> 00:00:09,176
to turn everybody
into her slaves.

4
00:00:09,259 --> 00:00:10,677
But as you can see,

5
00:00:10,761 --> 00:00:12,971
I put a stop to that plan
lickety-split!

6
00:00:13,889 --> 00:00:16,183
The problem is solved
and everyone's safe.

7
00:00:16,266 --> 00:00:18,101
She even wanted to apologize.

8
00:00:18,185 --> 00:00:19,686
Please don't kill me, ma'am.

9
00:00:20,479 --> 00:00:22,522
It's happening so fast
I can hardly keep up.

10
00:00:22,606 --> 00:00:23,774
[sighs]

11
00:00:24,775 --> 00:00:26,401
[♪ opening music begins]

12
00:01:50,736 --> 00:01:52,404
[♪ opening music ends]

13
00:01:54,531 --> 00:01:56,199
[crowd cheering]

14
00:01:57,034 --> 00:01:59,286
Can't remember the last
time we celebrated like this.

15
00:01:59,369 --> 00:02:01,413
Does anyone have an idea
what we're celebrating?

16
00:02:02,539 --> 00:02:05,167
It brings me joy to see
everyone smiling again,

17
00:02:05,792 --> 00:02:08,253
and none of this would have
been possible without your help.

18
00:02:08,337 --> 00:02:10,130
Oh, you really think so?

19
00:02:10,589 --> 00:02:11,465
[ELNA] Yes!

20
00:02:12,466 --> 00:02:15,218
If you hadn't arrived, we would
be Zariché's slaves by now.

21
00:02:16,136 --> 00:02:19,639
Savior, please honor me by
sharing one of your adventures.

22
00:02:19,723 --> 00:02:21,600
I'm certain that you have
countless tales.

23
00:02:21,683 --> 00:02:24,019
The Staff of the World
Tree is in your possession,

24
00:02:24,102 --> 00:02:25,854
you must have passed
many trials.

25
00:02:25,937 --> 00:02:28,315
I'm simply dying to know
how you found it.

26
00:02:30,192 --> 00:02:33,487
[LORNA] Oh, right. Truth is, I
didn't do anything to earn it.

27
00:02:35,155 --> 00:02:37,199
But to them,
it's not just a staff.

28
00:02:37,282 --> 00:02:39,284
It seems to be
really important.

29
00:02:41,203 --> 00:02:44,831
Your Majesty, forgive me.
I must be honest.

30
00:02:45,749 --> 00:02:48,168
You should know that I'm a
member of House Guugelheit.

31
00:02:48,835 --> 00:02:52,255
I'd like to tell you my story,
but only if you allow it.

32
00:02:55,258 --> 00:02:56,593
And that's what happened.

33
00:03:01,264 --> 00:03:02,307
That's awful.

34
00:03:04,184 --> 00:03:05,977
[LORNA] I knew
they'd be upset with me.

35
00:03:06,603 --> 00:03:08,146
Something's wrong with them if

36
00:03:08,230 --> 00:03:11,066
they're foolish enough to banish
our kind, powerful Savior!

37
00:03:11,149 --> 00:03:12,109
Huh?

38
00:03:12,859 --> 00:03:15,070
You can hear the gods'
words with your skill?

39
00:03:15,987 --> 00:03:18,698
And they describe all of the
innermost workings of our world?

40
00:03:19,491 --> 00:03:20,867
I can't believe it.

41
00:03:22,411 --> 00:03:25,789
-Wait, so you're not mad at me?
-No, of course not.

42
00:03:26,456 --> 00:03:28,500
Even though I'm the daughter
of House Guugelheit?

43
00:03:29,334 --> 00:03:31,336
And I didn't earn this staff,
I cheated.

44
00:03:32,295 --> 00:03:33,213
Which is why...

45
00:03:34,673 --> 00:03:37,759
I wish to return it to its
rightful place with the elves.

46
00:03:39,469 --> 00:03:42,472
It's too bad I can't use all
that crazy magic on my own.

47
00:03:42,556 --> 00:03:44,808
I'm not tough enough
to adventure without it.

48
00:03:45,475 --> 00:03:46,476
I'd be toast.

49
00:03:47,227 --> 00:03:48,145
So that's it then.

50
00:03:48,603 --> 00:03:49,813
My journey ends here.

51
00:03:51,106 --> 00:03:53,316
Oh, is that what you were
worried about, Savior?

52
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:54,234
Wait, huh?

53
00:03:54,317 --> 00:03:55,986
[both chuckle]

54
00:03:56,069 --> 00:03:58,363
How you obtained the
World Staff is a small concern

55
00:03:58,447 --> 00:04:00,031
for someone who has
such great power.

56
00:04:00,115 --> 00:04:01,408
Small concern?

57
00:04:02,075 --> 00:04:05,704
Absolutely. It's not the trials
that hold significance.

58
00:04:05,787 --> 00:04:07,581
It's what you have done
here today.

59
00:04:08,081 --> 00:04:08,707
[Lorna gasps]

60
00:04:09,708 --> 00:04:11,460
That's what's important,
Lady Lorna.

61
00:04:12,169 --> 00:04:14,004
We saw how you saved
this village.

62
00:04:14,838 --> 00:04:17,174
and possibly the entire world.

63
00:04:17,674 --> 00:04:19,134
[Lorna gasps]

64
00:04:20,218 --> 00:04:21,553
I decree that from here on out,

65
00:04:21,636 --> 00:04:23,680
you shall be known as the
greatest savior ever!

66
00:04:23,764 --> 00:04:26,308
I wasn't aware you were
making decrees now.

67
00:04:26,808 --> 00:04:29,144
[chuckles]
Thank you for the kind words.

68
00:04:30,228 --> 00:04:31,980
They're so nice.

69
00:04:32,063 --> 00:04:34,483
I received a lifetime's
worth of compliments today.

70
00:04:36,151 --> 00:04:39,154
Curse the House of Guugelheit.
Aside from you, of course.

71
00:04:40,572 --> 00:04:43,116
That wretched family's been
ruining the forest's ley lines

72
00:04:43,200 --> 00:04:44,284
for quite a while.

73
00:04:44,910 --> 00:04:47,120
I hoped they would stay away
after we had warned them,

74
00:04:47,204 --> 00:04:48,622
but our attempts proved futile.

75
00:04:49,456 --> 00:04:51,333
[LORNA] Yeah,
I'm really sorry about that.

76
00:04:51,416 --> 00:04:53,460
Hush, you need not apologize.

77
00:04:54,294 --> 00:04:56,546
For a family
that's so fixated on power,

78
00:04:56,630 --> 00:04:58,173
their cruelty toward you
might be

79
00:04:58,256 --> 00:04:59,633
their gravest mistake yet.

80
00:04:59,716 --> 00:05:01,510
With you on their side,

81
00:05:01,593 --> 00:05:03,595
they may well have reached
the height of prosperity by now.

82
00:05:03,678 --> 00:05:04,721
[LORNA] She's scary.

83
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:07,140
Mother, stop it!

84
00:05:07,224 --> 00:05:09,351
Are you trying to scare
our savior?

85
00:05:10,477 --> 00:05:13,146
-I got a little carried away.
-It's fine.

86
00:05:13,563 --> 00:05:15,106
And I know it's getting late,

87
00:05:15,190 --> 00:05:17,359
so you should probably come
stay at my house tonight.

88
00:05:17,442 --> 00:05:19,653
-Wait, are you sure?
-It's not a problem.

89
00:05:20,612 --> 00:05:23,323
And by the way, savior, would
you mind showing me your skill?

90
00:05:25,742 --> 00:05:27,244
[LORNA] Give me one second.

91
00:05:27,327 --> 00:05:29,412
I need to turn off
incognito mode first.

92
00:05:30,705 --> 00:05:32,666
[Elna gasps]
It appeared out of thin air!

93
00:05:33,500 --> 00:05:36,628
Oh my, so the wisdom of the gods
appears on this glowing slab?

94
00:05:38,463 --> 00:05:40,340
Nothing happens when I touch it.

95
00:05:40,423 --> 00:05:42,467
[ELNA]
So the gods wrote all of this?

96
00:05:43,343 --> 00:05:45,387
My mortal brain can't
understand what I'm seeing.

97
00:05:45,470 --> 00:05:48,014
How frustrating! The word of
gods laid right before us

98
00:05:48,098 --> 00:05:50,225
and we can't even read
their divine language?

99
00:05:50,308 --> 00:05:51,643
Yeah, I felt the same way.

100
00:05:51,726 --> 00:05:53,645
What does this passage say,
Lady Lorna?

101
00:05:53,728 --> 00:05:56,731
Huh?
Oh, this one here says "lol".

102
00:05:57,315 --> 00:05:59,276
"Lol"? What's that?

103
00:05:59,359 --> 00:06:01,444
I've learned that whenever
you see this "lol" word

104
00:06:01,528 --> 00:06:03,697
in the gods' language,
it represents laughter.

105
00:06:04,364 --> 00:06:06,783
They vary it up, too.
So instead of "lol",

106
00:06:06,866 --> 00:06:09,286
they sometimes
either use "“rofl"” or "“lmao"”.

107
00:06:10,078 --> 00:06:11,371
Oh, is that so?

108
00:06:11,454 --> 00:06:13,540
I think I'm beginning
to understand it now.

109
00:06:13,623 --> 00:06:17,043
They have chosen melodic sounds
to express laughter and joy.

110
00:06:17,127 --> 00:06:18,837
Such a divine way
to communicate.

111
00:06:18,920 --> 00:06:20,046
"Lmao!"

112
00:06:20,714 --> 00:06:23,383
My goodness, that is such
a beautiful and poetic word!

113
00:06:23,884 --> 00:06:25,427
Splendid!
I believe this would be

114
00:06:25,510 --> 00:06:27,554
an appropriate situation
to use "lol".

115
00:06:27,637 --> 00:06:29,431
I'm speaking the gods' words!

116
00:06:29,514 --> 00:06:32,183
I can't help but "lol"
when I look upon the Savior!

117
00:06:32,851 --> 00:06:35,645
Wow, your mastery of their
language is making me ruffle!

118
00:06:35,729 --> 00:06:38,315
[all laugh]

119
00:06:40,567 --> 00:06:42,360
[elf cries]
We're going to miss you.

120
00:06:43,528 --> 00:06:45,238
Are you really leaving, Savior?

121
00:06:46,197 --> 00:06:48,283
Yes.
Thank you for being so nice.

122
00:06:48,867 --> 00:06:50,410
All of the elves adore you.

123
00:06:50,493 --> 00:06:52,621
You know you don't have
to leave us.

124
00:06:52,704 --> 00:06:54,748
You could live a tranquil life
in our community

125
00:06:54,831 --> 00:06:56,750
with all of your needs
provided for.

126
00:06:58,126 --> 00:06:59,002
Sounds neat.

127
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:02,130
If I came here at the beginning
of my journey,

128
00:07:02,964 --> 00:07:05,550
way back before I understood how
to use my "“the Internet"” skill,

129
00:07:05,634 --> 00:07:07,302
I might have accepted
your offer.

130
00:07:08,219 --> 00:07:10,096
But now I have a goal.

131
00:07:10,972 --> 00:07:13,350
I want to travel the world
and see everything.

132
00:07:15,769 --> 00:07:18,188
I want to try lots
of different foods,

133
00:07:18,271 --> 00:07:21,816
see all the beautiful sights,
meet all kinds of great people,

134
00:07:22,442 --> 00:07:24,361
and earn their gratitude
by saving them.

135
00:07:26,571 --> 00:07:28,949
I wouldn't have figured
that out if not for you.

136
00:07:29,658 --> 00:07:31,618
So in a way,
you all saved me, too.

137
00:07:32,494 --> 00:07:33,578
I understand.

138
00:07:34,454 --> 00:07:36,331
It would be selfish
to try and stop you.

139
00:07:37,540 --> 00:07:40,043
Leave us.
But I'd like you to have this.

140
00:07:42,087 --> 00:07:44,297
It is a symbol of friendship
with the elves.

141
00:07:45,465 --> 00:07:47,550
My gift to you.
As long as you carry it,

142
00:07:47,634 --> 00:07:49,594
the human king
and nobles will treat you

143
00:07:49,678 --> 00:07:52,722
-with the utmost respect.
-It seems precious to you.

144
00:07:52,806 --> 00:07:54,683
You sure you want
to give it to me?

145
00:07:54,766 --> 00:07:57,227
It doesn't begin to repay
what we owe you.

146
00:07:57,310 --> 00:07:59,646
You have given us all
a reason to be happy again.

147
00:08:00,438 --> 00:08:01,314
[gasps softly]

148
00:08:02,524 --> 00:08:04,484
Know that you're always
welcome to come back.

149
00:08:05,318 --> 00:08:07,362
Our people will never
forget your kindness.

150
00:08:07,862 --> 00:08:09,948
You'll forever be allied
with elves.

151
00:08:10,782 --> 00:08:14,077
And this land. It will
always have a place for you.

152
00:08:15,495 --> 00:08:18,498
Thanks. I promise you,
I'll come back someday.

153
00:08:18,581 --> 00:08:21,126
We'll look forward to
seeing you again, Savior.

154
00:08:21,418 --> 00:08:23,336
Until that moment comes,

155
00:08:23,420 --> 00:08:25,422
may you set upon a journey
complete with "“lols"” aplenty.

156
00:08:25,505 --> 00:08:27,132
Ready, and...

157
00:08:27,716 --> 00:08:29,175
[ALL] Lol!

158
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:32,262
[door closes]
[ELMINA] There.

159
00:08:33,513 --> 00:08:36,057
From the life of an elite
to the life of a mere peasant.

160
00:08:36,766 --> 00:08:39,561
My, my.
Look at how far I've fallen.

161
00:08:40,729 --> 00:08:41,688
Anyway...

162
00:08:43,231 --> 00:08:44,274
Mana Search.

163
00:08:45,233 --> 00:08:46,776
[Elmina laughs]

164
00:08:46,860 --> 00:08:49,112
As I said before,
Lorna Hermit is nothing to fear.

165
00:08:49,696 --> 00:08:52,365
But just in case, I've secured
multiple escape routes.

166
00:08:52,449 --> 00:08:55,326
My plan to escape by night
is virtually flawless.

167
00:08:55,410 --> 00:08:57,495
When you're an elite,
you can even make fleeing

168
00:08:57,579 --> 00:08:59,539
from some crazy
demon girl look masterful.

169
00:09:00,415 --> 00:09:04,002
Hmm? Huh? What's with the...

170
00:09:04,502 --> 00:09:06,296
Holy crap,
it's headed right for me!

171
00:09:06,379 --> 00:09:08,298
Miss Elmina!

172
00:09:08,673 --> 00:09:10,592
[Elmina screams]

173
00:09:13,178 --> 00:09:15,388
[ELMINA]
What does she want from me now?

174
00:09:15,930 --> 00:09:18,266
Hang on, were you
on your way somewhere?

175
00:09:18,349 --> 00:09:19,976
Uh, no, not at all.

176
00:09:20,685 --> 00:09:22,562
Just home renovations.

177
00:09:22,645 --> 00:09:25,273
Anyway, what can I do
for you, Lorna Hermit?

178
00:09:25,356 --> 00:09:27,358
I just returned from
the hidden elf village,

179
00:09:27,442 --> 00:09:29,235
and I brought you
back a little gift.

180
00:09:29,319 --> 00:09:31,613
What? The hidden elf village?

181
00:09:31,696 --> 00:09:35,366
[LORNA] That's right.
And look what I got. Ta-da!

182
00:09:36,451 --> 00:09:39,454
[ELMINA] A crown? Whose crown?
I'm shaking!

183
00:09:40,538 --> 00:09:42,457
Um, thanks,
but you really shouldn't have.

184
00:09:43,208 --> 00:09:44,209
[Lorna giggles]

185
00:09:44,292 --> 00:09:46,044
It comes with an epic story too.

186
00:09:46,127 --> 00:09:47,504
You'll never guess how I got it.

187
00:09:47,879 --> 00:09:49,631
[ELMINA] I'm all ears.

188
00:09:49,714 --> 00:09:53,092
Get this, I beat a real meanie
and they ended up dropping it!

189
00:09:54,010 --> 00:09:56,387
[ELMINA] She defeated an
enemy and seized their crown?

190
00:09:56,471 --> 00:09:57,472
That means...

191
00:09:58,723 --> 00:10:00,100
she usurped the throne?

192
00:10:01,267 --> 00:10:02,811
[Elmina gasps]
Come to think of it...

193
00:10:04,562 --> 00:10:07,148
The calamities that occurred
in the Ipple Woods recently...

194
00:10:07,816 --> 00:10:10,109
if I'm not mistaken,
they were concentrated

195
00:10:10,193 --> 00:10:11,653
around the Lost Mist Barrier.

196
00:10:12,654 --> 00:10:14,072
Which can only mean...

197
00:10:14,155 --> 00:10:15,031
[Elmina gasps]

198
00:10:16,491 --> 00:10:18,660
This demon is the one
who caused those disasters!

199
00:10:18,743 --> 00:10:21,120
Her evil scheme was
to destroy the hidden village

200
00:10:21,204 --> 00:10:22,330
from outside the barrier!

201
00:10:23,498 --> 00:10:25,625
And there were lots
of enemies inside the village.

202
00:10:26,334 --> 00:10:28,127
Dealing with the aftermath
really was a hassle.

203
00:10:28,211 --> 00:10:29,963
[ELMINA] The elves!

204
00:10:30,046 --> 00:10:32,715
Ah, well. Luckily, they dropped
a lot of valuable items,

205
00:10:32,799 --> 00:10:34,592
so I made a decent
amount of money.

206
00:10:34,676 --> 00:10:35,802
[Lorna giggles]

207
00:10:36,719 --> 00:10:39,430
[ELMINA] Describing such
a horrendous act with a smile!

208
00:10:39,514 --> 00:10:42,600
Bleak is the fate of anyone
who dares to defy Lorna Hermit.

209
00:10:42,684 --> 00:10:44,602
[Elmina gasps]

210
00:10:44,686 --> 00:10:46,271
Wait, if she came all the
way here to tell me that...

211
00:10:47,146 --> 00:10:49,691
Now that I'm done with the
elves, it's your turn to die.

212
00:10:49,774 --> 00:10:52,068
[Elmina screams] [sobbing]

213
00:10:52,152 --> 00:10:53,444
You feeling okay?

214
00:10:53,987 --> 00:10:56,155
Did I say something
to make you cry?

215
00:10:56,239 --> 00:10:58,324
Lorna! Don't, I'm begging you!

216
00:10:58,408 --> 00:10:59,784
Huh? Don't what?

217
00:11:00,827 --> 00:11:02,537
[LORNA] Wait a second,
I think I understand

218
00:11:02,620 --> 00:11:04,247
why she's crying right now.

219
00:11:04,330 --> 00:11:06,583
She feels bad
for the monsters I killed.

220
00:11:06,666 --> 00:11:10,003
Wow, Miss Elmina,
you really are a saint, huh?

221
00:11:10,086 --> 00:11:10,753
[Lorna giggles]

222
00:11:15,258 --> 00:11:18,970
So, for 100 Phantom leaves,
you'll receive 5,000,000 shil.

223
00:11:19,304 --> 00:11:20,972
Yay!

224
00:11:21,055 --> 00:11:23,099
Now I have plenty
of money to travel again.

225
00:11:23,600 --> 00:11:24,934
[Elmina sighs]

226
00:11:25,018 --> 00:11:27,228
[LORNA] There's one more thing.
Farewell.

227
00:11:27,312 --> 00:11:29,188
I've decided
that I'm leaving Aiphoné.

228
00:11:29,272 --> 00:11:31,399
Wait, you're really
leaving town?

229
00:11:31,482 --> 00:11:34,652
I am, and I wanted to say
bye to you before I left.

230
00:11:35,653 --> 00:11:37,238
So goodbye.

231
00:11:37,322 --> 00:11:39,490
Thank you so much for
everything, Miss Elmina.

232
00:11:40,825 --> 00:11:43,119
You've been a big help.
I won't forget you.

233
00:11:43,494 --> 00:11:45,663
It's over? If you're leaving,

234
00:11:45,747 --> 00:11:48,541
does that mean you are
finally finished with me?

235
00:11:48,625 --> 00:11:49,626
Say what?

236
00:11:50,418 --> 00:11:52,420
Uh, what does she mean
by finished with her?

237
00:11:52,503 --> 00:11:55,506
I feel like I should ask,
but I can't.

238
00:11:55,590 --> 00:11:57,634
The line behind me is
getting pretty crazy.

239
00:11:58,927 --> 00:12:01,262
Well, I don't want to be rude
and not say anything, so...

240
00:12:02,055 --> 00:12:04,641
Maybe, maybe not.
I haven't decided yet.

241
00:12:04,724 --> 00:12:07,352
[Elmina screams]

242
00:12:08,269 --> 00:12:09,145
Bye!

243
00:12:10,355 --> 00:12:12,398
That girl is really
gonna kill me.

244
00:12:12,774 --> 00:12:14,067
Time for my lunch break.

245
00:12:14,692 --> 00:12:16,110
Are you okay, Lady Elmina?

246
00:12:16,569 --> 00:12:17,737
[MAN] Lady Elmina!

247
00:12:20,323 --> 00:12:22,116
[swords clashing]

248
00:12:23,618 --> 00:12:25,119
Father, we need to leave now!

249
00:12:25,203 --> 00:12:27,038
Palace knights have launched
an attack!

250
00:12:27,121 --> 00:12:28,581
Those wretched fools!

251
00:12:28,665 --> 00:12:31,167
It's holding, but the manor's
weakening by the second.

252
00:12:31,751 --> 00:12:33,461
We'll let the soldiers
serve as decoys

253
00:12:33,544 --> 00:12:35,338
and escape
using the secret passage.

254
00:12:36,297 --> 00:12:38,091
[BRAU] How did this happen?

255
00:12:38,174 --> 00:12:40,760
Could it be our plot at the
hidden elf village was exposed?

256
00:12:40,843 --> 00:12:43,680
Or is this about
the major ley line vanishing?

257
00:12:44,597 --> 00:12:46,391
-Father, help me!
-[BRAU] Browser!

258
00:12:47,725 --> 00:12:48,685
[ELLHAR] There you are.

259
00:12:49,852 --> 00:12:51,938
It seems that I've discovered
the secret passageway

260
00:12:52,021 --> 00:12:53,356
the Savior mentioned.

261
00:12:54,065 --> 00:12:58,278
[BRAU] So it's you,
the Elf Queen, Ellhar!

262
00:12:58,861 --> 00:13:01,322
Indeed. It's been
a long time, Guugelheit.

263
00:13:01,406 --> 00:13:03,282
Aren't you excited to see me?

264
00:13:03,366 --> 00:13:05,201
Why have you come to my kingdom?

265
00:13:06,077 --> 00:13:08,579
Didn't Zariché's toxin put
her on the brink of death?

266
00:13:10,707 --> 00:13:12,333
[screams]

267
00:13:12,417 --> 00:13:14,544
Stop! Why are you doing this?

268
00:13:14,961 --> 00:13:16,713
That's a question
to ask yourself.

269
00:13:17,213 --> 00:13:18,756
Huh?

270
00:13:18,840 --> 00:13:20,508
You think you can just
cause harm to my people

271
00:13:20,591 --> 00:13:23,344
and get away with it?
Well, you are mistaken.

272
00:13:24,554 --> 00:13:26,764
And unfortunately for you,
I am big mad!

273
00:13:27,432 --> 00:13:29,642
[BRAU] Is that some sort
of ancient expression?

274
00:13:29,726 --> 00:13:32,353
I will eliminate you
right here and now.

275
00:13:32,437 --> 00:13:35,273
Then our savior, Lady Lorna,
will be free to roam these lands

276
00:13:35,356 --> 00:13:37,567
once more. You should have
treated her much better.

277
00:13:37,650 --> 00:13:40,403
You would end my life
over that weak little girl?

278
00:13:40,486 --> 00:13:42,113
She's anything but weak.

279
00:13:42,613 --> 00:13:44,449
It's ironic that your obsession
with power

280
00:13:44,532 --> 00:13:46,200
was what led you
to banish Lorna.

281
00:13:46,284 --> 00:13:48,327
You had no idea
that your daughter,

282
00:13:48,411 --> 00:13:52,248
that weak little girl, is really
the world's strongest witch.

283
00:13:52,332 --> 00:13:54,709
But I checked her skill myself!
That can't be possible!

284
00:13:55,626 --> 00:13:57,670
No, she's the world's
strongest witch?

285
00:13:57,754 --> 00:14:00,089
With the world's most
foolish man as a father.

286
00:14:00,631 --> 00:14:02,383
Let us end this once
and for all.

287
00:14:02,467 --> 00:14:04,969
For so long, everything went
according to plan,

288
00:14:05,053 --> 00:14:08,473
but now it's completely ruined!
Why is this happening now?

289
00:14:08,556 --> 00:14:11,726
[screams] I could care less
if she's the strongest witch.

290
00:14:11,809 --> 00:14:14,896
I don't understand how it didn't
work. I had it all figured out.

291
00:14:14,979 --> 00:14:16,522
You don't understand?

292
00:14:16,606 --> 00:14:18,608
Then please allow me
to quote a few divine words

293
00:14:18,691 --> 00:14:20,068
from the gods themselves.

294
00:14:20,902 --> 00:14:23,279
-Release me!
-Google it, you idiot!

295
00:14:25,615 --> 00:14:26,532
It's over now.

296
00:14:27,408 --> 00:14:28,618
Thank you for your assistance.

297
00:14:30,370 --> 00:14:31,829
[ELLHAR] Insolent man.

298
00:14:31,913 --> 00:14:34,040
Between him and the
Queen's Heart Rose Seed,

299
00:14:34,123 --> 00:14:35,291
I know trouble's afoot.

300
00:14:36,501 --> 00:14:38,461
The forces of darkness
are unveiling themselves,

301
00:14:38,544 --> 00:14:40,880
and they're only going
to keep growing stronger.

302
00:14:42,423 --> 00:14:45,718
And yet, I know that the world
will be just fine

303
00:14:45,802 --> 00:14:47,386
with Lady Lorna around.

304
00:14:48,763 --> 00:14:50,014
[Lorna sneezes]

305
00:14:57,188 --> 00:14:58,648
Before we begin,
I'd like to know

306
00:14:58,731 --> 00:15:00,441
why we're meeting
in these ruins.

307
00:15:00,525 --> 00:15:03,444
It'll be easy for an outsider
to hear our discussion.

308
00:15:03,528 --> 00:15:06,656
Incorrect. We're within
a Lightning Forge stronghold.

309
00:15:08,241 --> 00:15:10,326
In addition to the artifact's
defense system,

310
00:15:10,409 --> 00:15:13,621
we have a secret weapon.
The ultimate guard dog.

311
00:15:14,122 --> 00:15:17,083
Eleone the Bolt Panthera
will keep outsiders away.

312
00:15:18,459 --> 00:15:21,629
Very good. But any news
about the Irregular?

313
00:15:21,712 --> 00:15:23,673
You're referring
to the mysterious girl

314
00:15:23,756 --> 00:15:26,008
that destroyed
House Guugelheit, correct?

315
00:15:26,092 --> 00:15:27,635
That's right.

316
00:15:27,718 --> 00:15:30,096
Not only has this human girl
conquered the elves,

317
00:15:30,179 --> 00:15:32,515
but she eliminated
the Guugelheit family

318
00:15:32,598 --> 00:15:35,184
and the "“Witch of
Incineration,"”
Elmina.

319
00:15:35,268 --> 00:15:38,688
Apparently, Zariché
has been defeated as well.

320
00:15:38,771 --> 00:15:40,606
Who cares?
They both had potential,

321
00:15:40,690 --> 00:15:42,733
but were simply weak
to begin with.

322
00:15:42,817 --> 00:15:45,486
Yes, but what of the
temple's strange events?

323
00:15:46,154 --> 00:15:47,697
It's all been too perfect.

324
00:15:48,489 --> 00:15:50,491
It's like this one girl
has access

325
00:15:50,575 --> 00:15:52,368
to information about all of us.

326
00:15:55,413 --> 00:15:56,789
All right, men, enough.

327
00:15:57,415 --> 00:15:59,542
There will be no change
to our plan, understood?

328
00:16:00,251 --> 00:16:02,170
The truth is,
the Seven Goddesses

329
00:16:02,253 --> 00:16:04,797
and the Generals of the Twelve
Stars are weakened.

330
00:16:04,881 --> 00:16:08,134
The records of the ancient Great
War have faded away as well.

331
00:16:09,385 --> 00:16:11,762
Whoever this girl is,
neither she nor any human

332
00:16:11,846 --> 00:16:14,557
of this naively peaceful era
are an obstacle.

333
00:16:14,640 --> 00:16:17,685
It's only a matter of time
before we have the incantation

334
00:16:17,768 --> 00:16:19,604
and can finally free them.

335
00:16:20,480 --> 00:16:22,690
I propose that we move
on to the next phase.

336
00:16:23,608 --> 00:16:26,777
We'll unleash our god.
Set Apocalypse Dragon Ragnadrek

337
00:16:26,861 --> 00:16:31,115
upon this tainted land, so that
it may go forth and purify it.

338
00:16:32,408 --> 00:16:34,327
Our time is approaching.

339
00:16:34,410 --> 00:16:36,495
The age of darkness will return,

340
00:16:36,579 --> 00:16:39,457
and the ancient kingdom
will rise once more.

341
00:16:39,540 --> 00:16:41,375
The hour is nigh, men.

342
00:16:42,084 --> 00:16:45,379
At last, let us begin
our Eternal Historia Plot!

343
00:16:45,671 --> 00:16:48,299
[bishops laughing]

344
00:16:48,382 --> 00:16:50,593
[bishops laughing]

345
00:16:51,385 --> 00:16:54,055
[laughs, gasps]

346
00:16:58,643 --> 00:17:00,895
-Her mana's tremendous!
-I see it as well.

347
00:17:00,978 --> 00:17:02,188
I can't imagine us beating her

348
00:17:02,271 --> 00:17:04,106
even if the six of us
work together.

349
00:17:05,316 --> 00:17:07,693
Whoever this child is,
she's powerful.

350
00:17:09,654 --> 00:17:12,615
[ALL] Who is she?
And how'd she get in here?!

351
00:17:14,825 --> 00:17:16,994
[LORNA] I'm lucky
to have found this place.

352
00:17:17,078 --> 00:17:19,664
I can escape the rain and enjoy
some tea at the same time.

353
00:17:20,289 --> 00:17:21,540
I don't know
who these guys are,

354
00:17:21,624 --> 00:17:23,668
but they must be here
for the same reason.

355
00:17:23,751 --> 00:17:26,254
Why else would they be
wearing those fancy raincoats?

356
00:17:28,547 --> 00:17:31,550
So, I'm inside the Old
Church of the Twilight?

357
00:17:31,634 --> 00:17:33,552
Wait, this is a church?
There's nothing here

358
00:17:33,636 --> 00:17:35,012
but a table and chairs.

359
00:17:36,597 --> 00:17:37,515
[Lorna yawns]

360
00:17:37,598 --> 00:17:39,141
[all gasp]

361
00:17:39,225 --> 00:17:41,143
Bishops, did any of you
happen to invite this

362
00:17:41,227 --> 00:17:43,604
-little girl to our meeting?
-I didn't. I just assumed

363
00:17:43,688 --> 00:17:47,066
one of you did since she walked
in and sat down so casually.

364
00:17:47,608 --> 00:17:50,069
Well, whoever she is,
she's immensely powerful.

365
00:17:50,152 --> 00:17:53,030
She was able to find this place
and get past the Bolt Panthera.

366
00:17:53,114 --> 00:17:55,700
She's sitting in the seat of
honor like she belongs there.

367
00:17:56,784 --> 00:17:59,412
Obviously, she must be a
high-ranking cult member.

368
00:17:59,495 --> 00:18:01,622
If that was the case,
I'm certain we would've heard

369
00:18:01,706 --> 00:18:03,165
about her, but we haven't.

370
00:18:03,874 --> 00:18:07,295
No records, reports, not even
a rumor. Nothing at all!

371
00:18:07,378 --> 00:18:10,006
I believe this is
who we've been waiting for.

372
00:18:10,881 --> 00:18:13,634
Just take a look at the
garment she's wearing, bishops.

373
00:18:13,718 --> 00:18:17,096
Come to think of it, that
pattern, that latent power...

374
00:18:17,179 --> 00:18:20,349
Could it be? Ragnarobe,
the Apocalypse Dragon Robes?

375
00:18:20,433 --> 00:18:21,517
That's right.

376
00:18:21,601 --> 00:18:23,352
Behold, my comrades,

377
00:18:23,436 --> 00:18:26,480
she is wearing the same robes
they wore in their human form.

378
00:18:27,440 --> 00:18:29,692
But how exactly? I thought
that the robes were sealed away

379
00:18:29,775 --> 00:18:31,360
underground along with them.

380
00:18:32,403 --> 00:18:33,696
[ALL] Wait a second.

381
00:18:33,779 --> 00:18:36,449
Is it possible
that this little girl is...

382
00:18:36,532 --> 00:18:38,326
[LORNA] Huh?
They keep looking at me

383
00:18:38,409 --> 00:18:40,036
like I have something
on my face.

384
00:18:40,661 --> 00:18:42,413
Hang on, are these guys...?

385
00:18:43,706 --> 00:18:45,624
She's more powerful
than we thought!

386
00:18:45,708 --> 00:18:49,712
-The space warped!
-That's possible? That means...

387
00:18:50,671 --> 00:18:52,214
What a glorious day!

388
00:18:52,298 --> 00:18:54,175
We're in the presence
of our god incarnate,

389
00:18:54,258 --> 00:18:56,218
gazing upon a portion
of their power!

390
00:18:56,719 --> 00:18:58,346
[LORNA] I think I get it now.

391
00:18:58,888 --> 00:19:00,681
I don't see their belongings
anywhere.

392
00:19:00,765 --> 00:19:03,142
Maybe they got burned up
by lightning or something.

393
00:19:04,310 --> 00:19:06,395
They've been whispering
and glancing at me,

394
00:19:06,479 --> 00:19:09,357
and now they've put their hands
together like they're begging.

395
00:19:09,440 --> 00:19:11,692
That's it!
There's not a doubt in my mind.

396
00:19:11,776 --> 00:19:14,236
I know exactly
what's going on here.

397
00:19:14,987 --> 00:19:16,822
These gentlemen
are just thirsty!

398
00:19:16,906 --> 00:19:18,240
[bishops gasp]

399
00:19:18,866 --> 00:19:21,202
This must be a test of loyalty.

400
00:19:21,827 --> 00:19:23,662
They abandoned
their dragon body

401
00:19:24,413 --> 00:19:27,083
and transferred their soul
to this human girl.

402
00:19:28,334 --> 00:19:30,336
They approached
without saying anything,

403
00:19:30,836 --> 00:19:32,421
perhaps to see
if we recognize them

404
00:19:32,505 --> 00:19:34,298
and offer our undying faith.

405
00:19:35,591 --> 00:19:38,177
Yes, I believe that's the
only logical explanation.

406
00:19:38,260 --> 00:19:40,221
We're being tested.

407
00:19:40,304 --> 00:19:42,598
If this is them, we need to
pledge our loyalty immediately.

408
00:19:43,682 --> 00:19:47,269
Uh, sorry, it's not water,
but is tea okay for everybody?

409
00:19:47,353 --> 00:19:49,146
Tea?

410
00:19:49,230 --> 00:19:51,565
Does this gift mean she sees
us as her loyal servants?

411
00:19:51,649 --> 00:19:54,443
Perhaps.
Our god is merciful indeed.

412
00:19:54,527 --> 00:19:56,946
[ALL] From this day forward,
we vow to serve you

413
00:19:57,029 --> 00:19:58,531
for the remainder of our lives!

414
00:19:59,615 --> 00:20:01,700
[LORNA] Wow, they must have
been really, really thirsty.

415
00:20:02,785 --> 00:20:04,537
Ah, well.
A t least I didn't walk

416
00:20:04,620 --> 00:20:05,996
into a place full of creeps.

417
00:20:06,747 --> 00:20:08,582
I love interactions like these.

418
00:20:08,666 --> 00:20:10,584
They're the best part
of traveling!

419
00:20:11,794 --> 00:20:14,004
Not like my previous
adventures.

420
00:20:14,088 --> 00:20:15,798
No calamities involved.

421
00:20:15,881 --> 00:20:18,300
No evil plots to take over
and conquer the world.

422
00:20:18,384 --> 00:20:20,386
And nobody is revering
me as their savior.

423
00:20:21,429 --> 00:20:23,180
It's just a normal tea party.

424
00:20:23,931 --> 00:20:26,350
If they were that thirsty, then
they're probably hungry too.

425
00:20:27,184 --> 00:20:28,644
Oh. Come to think of it.

426
00:20:29,270 --> 00:20:30,729
[men gasping]

427
00:20:33,482 --> 00:20:36,444
Good job!
First, mix the eggs and vinegar.

428
00:20:36,527 --> 00:20:38,612
Oh yeah. Apparently,
it's important to add

429
00:20:38,696 --> 00:20:40,573
the olive oil very slowly.

430
00:20:40,656 --> 00:20:43,659
Your will be done.
Pour olive oil slowly.

431
00:20:43,743 --> 00:20:46,120
If this delicacy
is loved by gods...

432
00:20:46,203 --> 00:20:48,205
Then we all shall create
the mayonnaise.

433
00:20:48,289 --> 00:20:50,708
[LORNA] I have a feeling you
guys will love it, too

434
00:20:50,791 --> 00:20:53,210
Believe me, mayonnaise is
really yummy and nutritious.

435
00:20:53,294 --> 00:20:55,129
It makes sense
gods eat this stuff

436
00:20:55,212 --> 00:20:57,882
like it's going out of style.
It comes in handy for when you

437
00:20:57,965 --> 00:21:00,259
need to eat something on the go,
and save your life

438
00:21:00,342 --> 00:21:01,969
if you've got a long journey.

439
00:21:02,052 --> 00:21:04,263
Whenever the gods visit other
worlds, they make this

440
00:21:04,346 --> 00:21:06,724
-and take it with them.
-I think I understand.

441
00:21:06,807 --> 00:21:10,144
So, this is much like those
accursed, thin elven biscuits.

442
00:21:10,227 --> 00:21:11,770
So useful!

443
00:21:11,854 --> 00:21:14,148
If we master this art
and are able to produce

444
00:21:14,231 --> 00:21:16,358
mayonnaise on a large scale,
we could ration it

445
00:21:16,442 --> 00:21:18,611
to our soldiers
and change the art of war.

446
00:21:18,694 --> 00:21:21,071
You're right, Bishop.
Such profound thinking.

447
00:21:22,072 --> 00:21:24,533
This is fun! Don't you guys
think it's pretty nice

448
00:21:24,617 --> 00:21:26,243
making yummy treats together?

449
00:21:26,327 --> 00:21:27,244
[ALL] Indeed!

450
00:21:29,205 --> 00:21:30,122
[Lorna groans]

451
00:21:30,873 --> 00:21:33,209
For some reason it's not
thickening like it should.

452
00:21:33,709 --> 00:21:35,002
[gasps]

453
00:21:35,085 --> 00:21:36,670
I know!
This should do the trick.

454
00:21:37,588 --> 00:21:39,215
All right, everybody,
let's watch this!

455
00:21:39,715 --> 00:21:41,383
-What is that?
-This here is called

456
00:21:41,467 --> 00:21:44,178
a recipe video.
It's pretty fancy stuff.

457
00:21:44,261 --> 00:21:46,430
A super smart teacher gives
you all sorts of tips

458
00:21:46,514 --> 00:21:48,265
and tricks to create
the best meals!

459
00:21:48,891 --> 00:21:51,685
-Huh? "“Create?"”
-It's the Book of Creation?

460
00:21:52,436 --> 00:21:54,688
Hmm? Just look.
You'll get it once you watch it.

461
00:21:56,106 --> 00:21:58,108
Sheesh!
What are you touching, huh?

462
00:21:58,192 --> 00:22:00,236
[men gasp]

463
00:22:00,319 --> 00:22:01,278
Huh?

464
00:22:01,737 --> 00:22:03,489
No, that shouldn't be growing.

465
00:22:03,781 --> 00:22:05,491
I'm your stepsister.

466
00:22:06,784 --> 00:22:09,995
[sobs]
Stepbro. Stop it, stepbro!

467
00:22:11,121 --> 00:22:13,082
[♪ closing music begins]

468
00:23:36,248 --> 00:23:37,499
[♪ closing music ends]

